    "notes": "All 12 views inspected plus full-size top and left orbits. Twin speaker grilles with real perforation geometry, cassette deck with a modelled tape inside, tuner scale, five slider controls, carry handle and a telescoping antenna. Scuffed grey plastic and metal read distinctly. Five texture maps handle the printed panels and decals.",
    "limitations": [
      "Decorative stickers show original chibi-style cartoon artwork with no wordmark or logo; replace the decal map if your storefront requires cleared artwork.",
      "Front panel carries a generic tuner scale, not a manufacturer name."
